      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَابِئٌ</span></b>  act. part. n. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَبَأَ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  A bull [app. a
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ثَوْرٌ وَحْشِىٌّ</span>] <i>that goes forth from one land</i> or
<i>country to another.</i> (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  A torrent <i>that
